id: tz_non_secure_execution_source
label: TrustZone Non-Secure Execution (Source Reference Only)
description: >
    Contains the source file for the pre-compiled binary added by the
    tz_non_secure_execution component. This component shall not be added to
    any project. It is only made available to reference what is pre-compiled
    in the tz_non_secure_execution binary blob.
package: platform_core
category: Platform|TrustZone
quality: production
metadata:
    sbom:
        license: Zlib
root_path: platform/common
source:
  - path: src/sl_tz_non_secure_execution_source.c
provides:
  - name: tz_non_secure_execution_source
requires:
  - name: device_series_3
